menu "Ambyte bench BLE diagnostics"

config AMBYTE_BLE_DIAG
    bool "Serve read-only diagnostics over BLE (bench only)"
    depends on BT_NIMBLE_ENABLED
    default n
    help
        Bench prototype (docs/bench/ble-diagnostics.md): advertise for 15 min
        after boot and serve the last heartbeat JSON plus the cached charger
        frame over an unauthenticated read-only GATT service. Enabled only by
        sdkconfig.bench.ble.defaults (env bench-ble). Never in a release build.

endmenu
